  "chatServerNotice": "{notice, select, rateLimit{Couldn’t send your message. You’re sending messages too quickly.} duplicate{Couldn’t send your message. It’s the same as one you sent less than 30 seconds ago.} subsOnly{Couldn’t send your message. This chat is in subscribers-only mode: subscribe to the channel to chat.} emoteOnly{Couldn’t send your message. This chat is in emote-only mode.} uniqueChat{Couldn’t send your message. This chat is in unique chat mode, and your message isn’t original.} followRequired{Couldn’t send your message. This chat is in followers-only mode: follow the channel to chat.} followedTooRecently{Couldn’t send your message. You haven’t followed this channel long enough to chat yet.} verifiedEmail{Couldn’t send your message. This channel requires a verified email address: verify yours in your Twitch security settings.} verifiedPhone{Couldn’t send your message. This channel requires a verified phone number: verify yours in your Twitch security settings.} emailAliasBanned{Couldn’t send your message. Your email address is banned from this channel.} phoneAliasBanned{Couldn’t send your message. Your phone number is banned from this channel.} channelSuspended{This channel doesn’t exist or is suspended.} accountSuspended{Couldn’t send your message. Your account is suspended.} channelBlocked{Couldn’t send your message. Your account isn’t in good standing in this channel.} userRestricted{Couldn’t send your message. Your account can’t send chat messages for now. Learn more at appeals.twitch.tv.} channelRestricted{Couldn’t send your message. This channel can’t receive chat messages for now.} invalidReply{Couldn’t send your reply. That message can’t be replied to.} unexpected{Couldn’t send your message. Try again.} badCharacters{Couldn’t send your message. It contains too many characters Twitch can’t process.} rejectedBySettings{Couldn’t send your message. It conflicts with the channel’s moderation settings.} tooManyChats{Too many chats are open at once